1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:01,873
("MST3K Love Theme" by Mike Nelson)

2
00:00:01,873 --> 00:00:04,204
♫ In the not too distant future

3
00:00:04,204 --> 00:00:07,108
♫ Way down in Deep 13

4
00:00:07,108 --> 00:00:10,212
♫ Dr. Forrester and TV's Frank

5
00:00:10,212 --> 00:00:13,504
♫ Were hatchin' an evil scheme

6
00:00:13,504 --> 00:00:16,337
♫ They hired a temp by the name of Mike

7
00:00:16,337 --> 00:00:19,553
♫ Just a regular Joe they didn't like

8
00:00:19,553 --> 00:00:22,573
♫ Their experiment needed a good test case

9
00:00:22,573 --> 00:00:24,141
♫ So they conked him on the noggin

10
00:00:24,141 --> 00:00:26,413
♫ And they shot him into space

11
00:00:26,413 --> 00:00:27,996
- [Mike] Let me go!

12
00:00:29,176 --> 00:00:32,200
♫ We'll send him cheesy movies

13
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,230
♫ The worst we can find

14
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:38,282
♫ He'll have to sit and watch them all

15
00:00:38,282 --> 00:00:41,472
♫ And we'll monitor his mind

16
00:00:41,472 --> 00:00:44,373
♫ Now keep in mind Mike can't control

17
00:00:44,373 --> 00:00:47,704
♫ Where the movies begin or end

18
00:00:47,704 --> 00:00:50,651
♫ He'll try to keep his sanity

19
00:00:50,651 --> 00:00:54,818
♫ With the help of his robot friends

20
00:00:55,915 --> 00:00:57,351
♫ Robot roll call

21
00:00:57,351 --> 00:00:58,560
♫ Cambot (show yourself)

22
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,206
♫ Gypsy (I'm not ready)

23
00:01:00,206 --> 00:01:01,596
♫ Tom Servo (hello there)

24
00:01:01,596 --> 00:01:03,306
♫ Crow (that's one "o")

25
00:01:03,306 --> 00:01:06,486
♫ If you're wondering
how he eats and breathes

26
00:01:06,486 --> 00:01:09,595
♫ And other science facts

27
00:01:09,595 --> 00:01:12,490
♫ Just repeat to yourself,
"It's just a show,

28
00:01:12,490 --> 00:01:15,750
♫ "I should really just relax

29
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:19,917
♫ "For Mystery Science Theater 3000" ♫

30
00:01:22,927 --> 00:01:25,677
(doors slamming)

31
00:01:34,933 --> 00:01:35,766
- Well, hi, everyone.

32
00:01:35,766 --> 00:01:38,358
Mike Nelson here, along
with Crow and Servo

33
00:01:38,358 --> 00:01:39,927
aboard the Satellite of Love.

34
00:01:39,927 --> 00:01:41,735
I thought we'd start things
a little differently,

35
00:01:41,735 --> 00:01:44,211
and why don't you join us
as, each in our own way,

36
00:01:44,211 --> 00:01:46,794
we observe a moment of silence.

37
00:01:49,356 --> 00:01:50,690
- God, this is great, eh?

38
00:01:50,690 --> 00:01:53,352
This is so spiritual, I just
can't believe it (chuckles)

39
00:01:53,352 --> 00:01:54,927
You know what this silent thing is like?

40
00:01:54,927 --> 00:01:55,868
Well, I'll tell ya.

41
00:01:55,868 --> 00:01:58,254
I feel like one of them
Trapper Monks or somethin'!

42
00:01:58,254 --> 00:01:59,776
(chuckles) No kidding, really!

43
00:01:59,776 --> 00:02:02,295
I feel so purified, my soul is as smooth

44
00:02:02,295 --> 00:02:04,377
as a baby's behind (chuckles).

45
00:02:04,377 --> 00:02:07,151
And I'm not just talkin'
insights here, no sir.

46
00:02:07,151 --> 00:02:08,401
I'm talkin' vision!

47
00:02:08,401 --> 00:02:10,437
I'm talkin' full-blown illumination!

48
00:02:10,437 --> 00:02:11,942
I'm talkin' about revelations

49
00:02:11,942 --> 00:02:13,305
shouted down from the mountain top.

50
00:02:13,305 --> 00:02:16,430
I'm talkin' huge, deafening
thunder claps of truth.

51
00:02:16,430 --> 00:02:18,096
We're beyond mere silence here, friends.

52
00:02:18,096 --> 00:02:19,764
We're in a mega silence!

53
00:02:19,764 --> 00:02:21,380
You've heard about the Big
Bang theory of silence?

54
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:22,779
This isn't "Mad Talk"!

55
00:02:22,779 --> 00:02:25,269
Boom! (cackles) Boy, is it quiet!

56
00:02:25,269 --> 00:02:26,912
Wowee, is this silence or what?

57
00:02:26,912 --> 00:02:29,334
I feel enlightenment, it's satori,

58
00:02:29,334 --> 00:02:32,938
it's like I'm sittin'
under the Bodhi tree!

59
00:02:32,938 --> 00:02:33,855
Wow! Ha ha!

60
00:02:34,692 --> 00:02:36,775
That was some round of silence, eh, gents?

61
00:02:36,775 --> 00:02:37,918
- [Mike and Crow] Yeah.

62
00:02:37,918 --> 00:02:39,455
- Well, hey, it doesn't have to end now.

63
00:02:39,455 --> 00:02:41,536
Heck, I could be silent like this all day!

64
00:02:41,536 --> 00:02:43,688
- Oh, you can't, 'cause Mike Johnson

65
00:02:43,688 --> 00:02:45,106
and Todd Langus are calling.

66
00:02:45,106 --> 00:02:45,939
- Who's that?

67
00:02:45,939 --> 00:02:47,346
- Uh, I went to grade school with them.

68
00:02:47,346 --> 00:02:48,731
- Well, how the hell
are we supposed to know

69
00:02:48,731 --> 00:02:49,942
the people you went to grade school with--

70
00:02:49,942 --> 00:02:51,943
(arguing indistinctly)

71
00:02:51,943 --> 00:02:53,016
(doorbell ringing)

72
00:02:53,016 --> 00:02:54,849
- Just a minute, Mike.

73
00:02:58,182 --> 00:02:59,895
(door creaKing)

74
00:02:59,895 --> 00:03:02,254
(heavenly music)

75
00:03:02,254 --> 00:03:04,421
- [Both] Our Chinese food!

76
00:03:07,235 --> 00:03:08,274
- Here, keep the dime.

77
00:03:08,274 --> 00:03:10,199
You did a great job.

78
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,949
- OK, let's see here.

79
00:03:14,471 --> 00:03:17,043
Hope they didn't forget
my tangerine chicken.

80
00:03:17,043 --> 00:03:18,460
Nope, here it is.

81
00:03:19,464 --> 00:03:21,881
And my chicken with broccoli.

82
00:03:22,833 --> 00:03:25,596
My chicken with baby corn.

83
00:03:25,596 --> 00:03:27,596
My chicken with peanuts.

84
00:03:29,365 --> 00:03:32,622
My chicken in a distinctive sauce.

85
00:03:32,622 --> 00:03:36,338
My chicken in sweet and
sour sauce with lemongrass.

86
00:03:36,338 --> 00:03:37,635
- Where's my mock duck?

87
00:03:37,635 --> 00:03:39,206
- "Where's my mock duck?"

88
00:03:39,206 --> 00:03:40,928
(chuckles) I'm kidding.

89
00:03:40,928 --> 00:03:43,433
Here, why don't you send
some of this stuff up

90
00:03:43,433 --> 00:03:45,201
to the Satellite of Love, OK?

91
00:03:45,201 --> 00:03:46,671
- OK.

92
00:03:46,671 --> 00:03:48,010
- Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

93
00:03:48,010 --> 00:03:49,010
I want this.

94
00:03:50,403 --> 00:03:52,638
