95
00:03:52,638 --> 00:03:56,055
(laughs) I'm so naughty.

96
00:03:57,671 --> 00:03:58,840
(crunching)

97
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,265
Oh, oh.

98
00:04:00,265 --> 00:04:03,952
"You have been summoned to
a place beyond this earth.

99
00:04:03,952 --> 00:04:06,964
"A place beyond your understanding.

100
00:04:06,964 --> 00:04:09,587
"A place filled with laughter and love,

101
00:04:09,587 --> 00:04:12,549
