112
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:42,699
It's weird, I keep getting the same one.

113
00:04:42,699 --> 00:04:46,519
What about you, Nelson,
have you gotten your order?

114
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:47,679
- Uh, yeah, I believe so.

115
00:04:47,679 --> 00:04:49,692
