119
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,588
- Well, no matter.

120
00:05:08,588 --> 00:05:10,796
I'm just gonna enjoy my hot and sour

121
00:05:10,796 --> 00:05:13,129
seafood and giant clam soup.

122
00:05:14,622 --> 00:05:15,463
Cracker in there.

123
00:05:15,463 --> 00:05:16,580
(clack)

124
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:17,830
Ah! What the...

125
00:05:21,024 --> 00:05:21,857
Ooh.

126
00:05:21,857 --> 00:05:23,560
OK, come on, come on.

127
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,727
Ooh, ow! Ooh, ooh, ow, ow!

128
