- [Servo] (humming)

1990
01:26:01,621 --> 01:26:02,780
Movie Town News presents,

1991
01:26:02,780 --> 01:26:04,280
The March of Time.

1992
01:26:05,595 --> 01:26:08,029
Oh damn, Martha Graham dancers.

1993
01:26:08,029 --> 01:26:10,196
(screams)

1994
01:26:11,864 --> 01:26:14,114
(laughter)

1995
01:26:15,908 --> 01:26:19,491
- [Mike] Oh damn, all
the biffies are full.

1996
01:26:20,810 --> 01:26:22,269
- [Crow] Panty raid. (laughter)

1997
01:26:22,269 --> 01:26:24,060
I'm kidding, of course.

1998
01:26:24,060 --> 01:26:26,231
I'm going to burn you to death.

1999
01:26:26,231 --> 01:26:30,138
- [Servo] Gee, I hope this
is the right thing to do.

2000
01:26:30,138 --> 01:26:34,805
- [Mike] Well, I'll just
let God sort them out.

2001
01:26:34,805 --> 01:26:36,808
- [Servo] That's always nice Samson.

2002
01:26:36,808 --> 01:26:38,560
Just torch everyone.

2003
01:26:38,560 --> 01:26:39,737
- [Mike] Bested at every turn,

2004
01:26:39,737 --> 01:26:40,794
and now you've got a chance to

2005
01:26:40,794 --> 01:26:43,627
light some helpless women on fire.

2006
01:26:45,327 --> 01:26:47,729
(screaming)

2007
01:26:47,729 --> 01:26:50,004
- [Crow] Well, I think
that's about everyone.

2008
01:26:50,004 --> 01:26:51,254
I'm outta here.

2009
01:26:52,157 --> 01:26:55,074
- [Mike] Authorities suspect arson.

2010
01:26:57,327 --> 01:26:58,160
- [Servo] Hi honey.

2011
01:26:58,160 --> 01:26:59,660
Gee it's great to be back at the castle.

2012
01:26:59,660 --> 01:27:01,677
Hope your sisters dress up,
Halloween, slumber party,

2013
01:27:01,677 --> 01:27:02,510
went well--

2014
01:27:02,510 --> 01:27:03,343
Oh my God!

2015
01:27:05,014 --> 01:27:07,181
- [Mike] It's a clown car.

2016
01:27:12,194 --> 01:27:13,708
- [Crow] Um, you can put me down.

2017
01:27:13,708 --> 01:27:15,254
I can walk.

2018
01:27:15,254 --> 01:27:16,107
You don't have to.

2019
01:27:16,107 --> 01:27:16,940
I can.

2020
01:27:16,940 --> 01:27:17,773
Put.

2021
01:27:17,773 --> 01:27:18,940
Could you put.

2022
01:27:19,805 --> 01:27:21,101
- [Servo] There's a lot of bodies, Samson.

2023
01:27:21,101 --> 01:27:23,851
We got some questions to ask you.

2024
01:27:24,884 --> 01:27:27,414
- [Mike] I decided not to burn this one.

2025
01:27:27,414 --> 01:27:28,569
- [Crow] Honey I hate to tell you this,

2026
01:27:28,569 --> 01:27:30,525
but an android from the
future is going to come

2027
01:27:30,525 --> 01:27:33,608
and kill you so you won't give birth.

2028
01:27:36,013 --> 01:27:36,847
- [Servo] A thundering tire,

2029
01:27:36,847 --> 01:27:37,880
a flashing turn signal,

2030
01:27:37,880 --> 01:27:40,047
and a hearty Hi-Ho Silver!

2031
01:27:43,192 --> 01:27:46,525
- [Mike] Goodbye sweet wrestling friend.

2032
01:27:48,262 --> 01:27:50,541
- God bless Samson.

2033
01:27:50,541 --> 01:27:51,859
- Who is he Papa?

2034
01:27:51,859 --> 01:27:52,692
- [Servo] God?

2035
01:27:52,692 --> 01:27:54,285
Well he's a Judeo-Christian.

2036
01:27:54,285 --> 01:27:56,934
- I don't think you'll ever know.

2037
01:27:56,934 --> 01:27:58,182
But I'll say this my dear,

2038
01:27:58,182 --> 01:27:59,015
- [Mike] He's a fruit cake.

2039
01:27:59,015 --> 01:28:00,604
- In this age where there
are certain evil men

2040
01:28:00,604 --> 01:28:02,699
who propose to destroy us,

2041
01:28:02,699 --> 01:28:05,527
Samson is an example to men of good will,

2042
01:28:05,527 --> 01:28:07,252
who serve justice.

2043
01:28:07,252 --> 01:28:08,466
- [Crow] Well I do what I can.

2044
01:28:08,466 --> 01:28:11,299
I gotta go rinse out a few things.

2045
01:28:13,579 --> 01:28:15,329
- [Mike] What a dope.

2046
01:28:19,149 --> 01:28:21,899
(doors slamming)

2047
01:28:30,206 --> 01:28:33,518
- Well guys, Frank is gone
and maybe now would be a good

2048
01:28:33,518 --> 01:28:35,031
time to read our letters to him.

2049
01:28:35,031 --> 01:28:36,093
Okay Tom Servo?

2050
01:28:36,093 --> 01:28:37,628
- Okay, lets see.

2051
01:28:37,628 --> 01:28:38,589
Dear Frank,

2052
01:28:38,589 --> 01:28:40,223
Well I guess I better be going.

2053
01:28:40,223 --> 01:28:42,536
Yours truly, Servo.

2054
01:28:42,536 --> 01:28:43,486
- Kinda short.

2055
01:28:43,486 --> 01:28:44,345
- That's nice.

2056
01:28:44,345 --> 01:28:45,178
Ugh, Crow how about you?

2057
01:28:45,178 --> 01:28:46,671
Do you have a nice letter?

2058
01:28:46,671 --> 01:28:48,764
- Dear Frank, you are a pig.

2059
01:28:48,764 --> 01:28:49,612
Love Crow.

2060
01:28:49,612 --> 01:28:50,527
- [All] (laughter)

2061
01:28:50,527 --> 01:28:52,385
- Come on you guys.

2062
01:28:52,385 --> 01:28:54,930
Now you're making fun of a guy
who's been very nice to us.

2063
01:28:54,930 --> 01:28:55,763
- Yeah.

2064
01:28:55,763 --> 01:28:56,786
- I mean sure Frank's dumb,

2065
01:28:56,786 --> 01:28:58,919
but you know we could
have had it a lot worse.

2066
01:28:58,919 --> 01:29:00,860
I bet Gypsy's letter is more appropriate.

2067
01:29:00,860 --> 01:29:02,790
- Yeah, thanks Mike.

2068
01:29:02,790 --> 01:29:06,667
Dear Frank, I'm glad that
you are in a better place.

2069
01:29:06,667 --> 01:29:07,778
Forrester is evil

2070
01:29:07,778 --> 01:29:10,189
and you have been a
welcome touch of kindness.

2071
01:29:10,189 --> 01:29:11,806
Others may put you down,

2072
01:29:11,806 --> 01:29:14,295
but I will always say,

2073
01:29:14,295 --> 01:29:16,346
give me my TV's Frank,

2074
01:29:16,346 --> 01:29:17,525
and when he shall die,

2075
01:29:17,525 --> 01:29:19,142
Cut him into tiny stars,

2076
01:29:19,142 --> 01:29:21,487
and he shall make the
face of heaven so fine,

2077
01:29:21,487 --> 01:29:24,066
that all the world will
fall in love with the night,

2078
01:29:24,066 --> 01:29:26,718
and pay no heed to the garish sun.

2079
01:29:26,718 --> 01:29:28,217
Amen.

2080
01:29:28,217 --> 01:29:30,610
- That was beautiful.

2081
01:29:30,610 --> 01:29:32,833
Not as poetic as Dear
Frank, you are a pig,

2082
01:29:32,833 --> 01:29:34,167
but still.

2083
01:29:34,167 --> 01:29:35,624
What?

2084
01:29:35,624 --> 01:29:36,958
♫ Maybe Frank,

2085
01:29:36,958 --> 01:29:39,201
♫ About Frank

2086
01:29:39,201 --> 01:29:41,553
♫ Cause Frank is ♫

2087
01:29:41,553 --> 01:29:43,207
Frank?

2088
01:29:43,207 --> 01:29:44,888
It really is you?

2089
01:29:44,888 --> 01:29:45,969
Speak to me Frank,

2090
01:29:45,969 --> 01:29:47,088
speak to me.

2091
01:29:47,088 --> 01:29:49,088
- Clay, close your robe.

2092
01:29:49,948 --> 01:29:50,948
- Oh, sorry.

2093
01:29:52,297 --> 01:29:53,499
- Oh, I just thought I'd check in

2094
01:29:53,499 --> 01:29:55,241
from the ethereal outer world,

2095
01:29:55,241 --> 01:29:57,173
and see how you're doing.

2096
01:29:57,173 --> 01:29:59,466
- Frank I can't believe I
won't be able to kill you

2097
01:29:59,466 --> 01:30:00,828
anymore.

2098
01:30:00,828 --> 01:30:02,295
- Don't worry, Clay.

2099
01:30:02,295 --> 01:30:05,627
Because somewhere deep inside your soul,

2100
01:30:05,627 --> 01:30:07,604
you'll always be killing me.

2101
01:30:07,604 --> 01:30:09,428
(chuckles)

2102
01:30:09,428 --> 01:30:12,041
And remember this, my sentimental friend.

2103
01:30:12,041 --> 01:30:14,801
Even though I will
forever be in your heart,

2104
01:30:14,801 --> 01:30:18,968
till the end of your days you'll
be a profoundly lonely man.

2105
01:30:20,496 --> 01:30:21,395
- Thank you, Frank.

2106
01:30:21,395 --> 01:30:23,325
That's very kind of you.

2107
01:30:23,325 --> 01:30:25,844
- And just let me say this to
anyone out there who's working

2108
01:30:25,844 --> 01:30:27,511
for an abusive boss.

2109
01:30:28,532 --> 01:30:30,391
Do not despair.

2110
01:30:30,391 --> 01:30:32,770
Never let him crush your spirit,

2111
01:30:32,770 --> 01:30:35,970
even if he's already crushed your skull.

2112
01:30:35,970 --> 01:30:38,381
Always be your self,

2113
01:30:38,381 --> 01:30:40,881
and wave your freak flag high.

2114
01:30:42,223 --> 01:30:45,621
- Geez it must be horrible
to work for boss like that.

2115
01:30:45,621 --> 01:30:46,727
Frank?

2116
01:30:46,727 --> 01:30:47,560
- Hum?

2117
01:30:47,560 --> 01:30:49,636
- Could I ask you one thing before you go?

2118
01:30:49,636 --> 01:30:50,469
- Sure.

2119
01:30:52,327 --> 01:30:53,611
- Could you,

2120
01:30:53,611 --> 01:30:55,178
push the button Frank?

2121
01:30:55,178 --> 01:30:57,671
- (chuckles)

2122
01:30:57,671 --> 01:30:58,838
Watch me rock.

2123
01:31:03,274 --> 01:31:05,520
(weird swallowing sound)

2124
01:31:05,520 --> 01:31:09,687
("MST3K Love Theme" by Mike Nelson)

2125
01:32:07,164 --> 01:32:07,997
(siren wailing)

2126
01:32:07,997 --> 01:32:11,414
- Chief I saw two corpses in the garden.

